  "hint": "<p>Write the arbitrary odd integer as <span class=\"math inline\">\\(n = 2m + 1\\)</span> and factor <span class=\"math inline\">\\(n^2 - 1\\)</span>. One of <span class=\"math inline\">\\(m\\)</span> and <span class=\"math inline\">\\(m + 1\\)</span> is even.</p>",
